# p5 mcp discover (read at ~6 s, between the third try and the fourth, 1+2+4 s of backoff): an HTTP server whose `server/discover` result lists only near misses
# of the client's versions, with instructions that are terminal escapes (mcphttp.ts
# `hostile`): no shared version (era.zig:206@481104fd), retrying. Nothing it wrote reaches
# the screen.
mcphttp hostile
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-http-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-http-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-hello.json
wait 6
type /mcp show fixture
key Enter
wait 1
snap show
gwlog
